# PoKeBoo — Adorable Multi-Agent Scheduling Backend

PokeBo is a chubby, adorable companion who gently helps you follow your schedule. She runs four specialist agents (STT, Classifier, Planner, Mood), supervises their proposals, vetoes the ones that don't fit your current state, and translates everything into warm, motivating speech.

This is the Python backend. The Rust overlay UI (the actual chubby sprite that waddles across your screen) will live in a sibling project and talk to this server over HTTP/WebSocket.

---

## Architecture

```
                         ┌──────────────────────────┐
                         │          USER            │
                         │  voice / text / UI tap   │
                         └────────────┬─────────────┘
                                      │
                                      ▼
                         ┌──────────────────────────┐
                         │     POKEBO (Manager)     │
                         │  ──────────────────────  │
                         │  • Persona: chubby,      │
                         │    adorable, motivational│
                         │  • Interpreter: turns    │
                         │    structured agent data │
                         │    → friendly user speech│
                         │  • Supervisor: relevancy │
                         │    score + veto power    │
                         │  • Single source of      │
                         │    personality           │
                         └─┬──────┬──────┬──────┬──┘
                           │      │      │      │
              ┌────────────┘      │      │      └────────────┐
              ▼                   ▼      ▼                   ▼
   ┌─────────────────┐  ┌──────────────┐  ┌──────────────┐
   │  STT Agent      │  │ Classifier   │  │  Mood Agent  │
   │  (audio→text    │  │ + Priorit.   │  │ (analyst +   │
   │   via Gemini    │  │ Agent        │  │  advisor)    │
   │   native audio) │  │              │  │              │
   └─────────────────┘  └──────┬───────┘  └──────┬───────┘
                               │                 │
                               ▼                 │
                        ┌──────────────┐         │
                        │ Planning     │ ◀───────┘
                        │ Agent        │  (mood influences plan)
                        │ (advisory)   │
                        └──────┬───────┘
                               │
                               ▼
                    ┌─────────────────────┐
                    │  DETERMINISTIC CORE │  ← no LLM, fully testable
                    │  • Rule-based       │
                    │    scheduler (final │
                    │    decider)         │
                    │  • Rule-based mood  │
                    │    engine (final    │
                    │    decider)         │
                    │  • SQLite storage   │
                    │    + audit trail    │
                    └─────────────────────┘
```

### Key invariants

1. **Agents never speak English to each other** — only structured JSON via `AgentProposal`
2. **PokeBo is the ONLY entity that produces user-facing natural language** — via the Interpreter
3. **LLM agents are advisory; rule-based core is the final decider** — deterministic, testable
4. **Every proposal is evaluated** — PokeBo assigns a `relevancy_score`; if it exceeds threshold, accept; else reject with constraints and ask for revision
5. **Every conflict is persisted + published** — full audit trail in SQLite + WebSocket events

