## Quick Start

> **Python 3.11+ required.**

### Setup

```powershell
cd C:\Users\asus\Desktop\Pokeboo!
pip install -e ".[dev]"
copy .env.example .env
# Edit .env: set GEMINI_API_KEY=your-key-from-https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
```

### Run tests (no API key needed)

```powershell
pytest
# → 18 passed in 0.16s
```

### Start the server

```powershell
pokeboo serve
# Or: python -m pokeboo serve
# Or: python run.py serve
# → open http://127.0.0.1:8000/docs
```

### Try it from another terminal

```powershell
pokeboo ingest-text "I have to file my Q2 taxes before midnight tonight"
pokeboo tasks
pokeboo mood
pokeboo conflicts
pokeboo drift --kind nap --minutes 60
```

### ⚠️ Do NOT do this

```powershell
# ❌ This fails — relative imports require package context:
python pokeboo\server.py

# ✅ Instead, use one of:
pokeboo serve
python -m pokeboo serve
python run.py serve
```

